Subject: [PATCH 2078/3799] soh: rename D_80B5F810 -> sCsCameraEyePoints8

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: the eyePoints array of sCsCameraMove entry 8; eyePoints is the second member of CutsceneCameraMove
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl4/z_en_zl4_cutscene_data.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl4/z_en_zl4_cutscene_data.c | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl4/z_en_zl4_cutscene_data.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_En_Zl4/z_en_zl4_cutscene_data.c
